    "pointer": "/classes/artificer/3/levels/15/0/d",
    "source": "Arcane Jolt rises to 4d6, your defender gains +2 AC, and its deflecting reaction also deals force damage to the attacker.",
    "sourceHash": "5671ba5e731570e11c254accf6cba5c6b66a80fb5a171a8394743fdf8414d322"
  },
